{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-374606-r4515542","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Ghavoot (Iranian Nut and Seed Powder)","sourcePageId":374606,"sourceRevision":"4515542","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2025-06-19T03:33:43Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Ghavoot%20(Iranian%20Nut%20and%20Seed%20Powder)&oldid=4515542","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T12:54:30.125Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Gluten-free recipes","Category:Iranian recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes using almond","Category:Recipes using chickpea","Category:Recipes using cinnamon","Category:Recipes using coffee","Category:Recipes using cottonseed","Category:Recipes using nuts and seeds","Category:Recipes using sesame","Category:Recipes using sugar","Category:Recipes with images","Category:Recipes without cooking time","Category:Recipes without servings","Category:Roasted recipes","Category:Side dish recipes","Category:Vegan recipes","Category:Very Easy recipes"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"431a34c1ad66ab77522538dba5523cec46fabac5fb361a1bb3391f2434e260cd","sourceWikitext":"{{recipesummary\n| Category = Iranian recipes\n| Difficulty = 1\n| Image = [[Image:Ghovvatoo.jpg|300px]]\n}}\n{{recipe}} | [[Cookbook:Cuisine of Iran|Cuisine of Iran]]\n\n'''Ghavoot''' (قاووت) or '''ghovvatoo''' (قووتو) is a nutritionally-dense recipe made of powdered seeds, nuts, and sugar. There are several versions, depending on the components chosen, and their ratios. It is a traditional souvenir of Kerman, Iran.\n\n==Ingredients ==\n\n* Coffee beans\n* [[Cookbook:Cinnamon|Cinnamon]]\n* [[Cookbook:Sesame Seed|Sesame seeds]]\n* [[Cookbook:Cottonseed|Cottonseeds]]\n* [[Cookbook:Nigella|Nigella]] seeds\n* [[Cookbook:Poppy Seed|Poppy seeds]]\n* [[Cookbook:Chickpea|Chickpeas]]\n* [[Cookbook:Walnut|Walnuts]]\n* [[Cookbook:Almond|Almonds]]\n* [[Cookbook:Pistachio|Pistachio]] nuts\n\n== Procedure ==\n\n# Grind and roast each component.\n# Add an equal weight of sugar; grind everything together.\n# Serve as powder, or blend it with milk or hot water.\n\n==Notes, tips, and variations==\n* Ghavoot is a traditional energizer. You can consume it as a pre-workout snack.\n\n[[Category:Recipes using nuts and seeds]]\n[[Category:Recipes using sesame]]\n[[Category:Recipes using chickpea]]\n[[Category:Recipes using coffee]]\n[[Category:Recipes using chickpea]]\n[[category:Iranian recipes]]\n[[category:Roasted recipes]]\n[[category:Side dish recipes]]\n[[Category:Vegan recipes]]\n[[category:Gluten-free recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using almond]]\n[[Category:Recipes using sugar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cinnamon]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cottonseed]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Ghavoot (Iranian Nut and Seed Powder)","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"Coffee beans","sourceText":"Coffee beans","amountText":"Coffee beans","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"Cinnamon","sourceText":"Cinnamon","amountText":"Cinnamon","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"Sesame seeds","sourceText":"Sesame seeds","amountText":"Sesame seeds","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":n